  "explanation": "<h3>Fair value of net identifiable assets</h3><p>$1,800,000 − $600,000 = $1,200,000.</p><h3>Consideration plus NCI</h3><p>$1,100,000 + $250,000 = $1,350,000.</p><h3>Goodwill</h3><p>$1,350,000 − $1,200,000 = $150,000.</p><h3>Advisory cost expense</h3><p>The stated acquisition-related advisory costs are expensed.</p>"
